msgstr "第 1 天：仿真中的首次运动"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:38
#: 78760e03f07643e5b67f9cbaf9d76127
msgid "**Goal:** Run a robot demo in mock hardware mode."
msgstr "**目标：** 在 mock 硬件模式下运行机器人演示。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:41
#: f6e679f787f846f6bf385d5124cf3153
msgid "Install prerequisites: Ubuntu 24.04, ROS 2 Jazzy"
msgstr "安装前提条件：Ubuntu 24.04、ROS 2 Jazzy"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:42
#: a03142089cfe42618a0ca7de9fa8e1e4
msgid "Clone `open-deploy-ws`:"
msgstr "克隆 `open-deploy-ws`："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:43
#: 725fd4a407a54b49a468ee44598cb963
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd open-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd open-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:48
#: 448b490c979f4566836c87a0e9823d88
msgid "Build the workspace:"
msgstr "编译工作空间："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:49
#: 320154077c1f474ba57698cf1b5bc439
msgid ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"colcon build --symlink-install\n"
msgstr ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"colcon build --symlink-install\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:53
#: f260bbabcff34226bfa2e400870e7483
msgid "Run a mock demo:"
msgstr "运行 mock 演示："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:54
#: 64a79ccc47ca420b87be5439a9d1fd09
msgid ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=mock\n"
msgstr ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=mock\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:59
#: 142163f3a67e4ba281824637e13dd2da
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [open-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws), [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [open-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws)、[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:61
#: 689ceaa606dc4baa8ac98d50fb7bc6a9
msgid "**Outcome:** A robot moves in RViz responding to MPC targets."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 机器人在 RViz 中响应 MPC 目标并运动。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:63
#: bfbd38a052214e6fa1645fd2370211c5
msgid "Day 2: Switch Robots"
msgstr "第 2 天：切换机器人"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:65
#: b35db74ea67944e0a18f07e25599ea5e
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Change the robot model and understand the description system."
msgstr "**目标：** 更换机器人模型，并理解描述系统。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:68
#: b3f70e7cbbd6497d8b68455c91ab2fbb
msgid "Initialize a different robot's description submodule:"
msgstr "初始化另一台机器人的描述子模块："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:69
#: d06a08cb420e44ceb26560c7384c6f20
msgid ""
"cd src/robot_descriptions\n"
"git submodule update --init robot-descriptions-arx\n"
msgstr ""
"cd src/robot_descriptions\n"
"git submodule update --init robot-descriptions-arx\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:73
#: d36efed09a7943be81aac090977173a1
msgid "Rebuild packages:"
msgstr "重新编译软件包："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:74
#: cda7af926d0446e286556554587c5eef
msgid "colcon build --packages-up-to robot-descriptions-arx\n"
msgstr "colcon build --packages-up-to robot-descriptions-arx\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:77
#: b279560a47df4fefbec84f2146806ad0
msgid "Launch with the new robot:"
msgstr "使用新机器人启动："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:78
#: 546ab5ee350e491f8dc7f5fa74ebdde9
msgid ""
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone "
"hardware:=mock\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone "
"hardware:=mock\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:81
#: 6b0fe2126c6f47928a427dad07880c7c
msgid ""
"`arx_acone` is the **Acone arm**, not Lift 2S. Full-body ARX Lift 2S uses "
"the `arx-lift2s` branch scripts — see [ARX Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md)."
msgstr ""
"`arx_acone` 是 **Acone 机械臂**，不是 Lift 2S。全身方舟无限 Lift 2S 使用 `arx-lift2s` 分支脚本 —"
" 见 [方舟无限 Lift 2S](../2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:83
#: 65789db926c64c23a510876767bc5566
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions), brand-specific READMEs"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions)、各品牌 README"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:85
#: fe623ea057dc4fe194f455817f294b6b
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** You can switch between Dobot CR5, Acone (arm), Galbot, etc."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 你可以在 Dobot CR5、Acone（机械臂）、Galbot 等机型之间切换。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:87
#: acfdd546497740489306060af8929a45
msgid "Day 3: Gazebo and Isaac Simulation"
msgstr "第 3 天：Gazebo 与 Isaac 仿真"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:89
#: 12147f73ccf942cabb0dfc269d9ed060
msgid "**Goal:** Run physics simulation instead of mock hardware."
msgstr "**目标：** 运行物理仿真，而不是 mock 硬件。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:91
#: 475e0dc88a2d4105a6328bb334f28752
msgid "Gazebo Harmonic"
msgstr "Gazebo Harmonic"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:93
#: 35a8883e4a904f9a925dc5751d63459b
msgid ""
"# Install Gazebo packages (if not already)\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Gazebo\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=gz\n"
msgstr ""
"# Install Gazebo packages (if not already)\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with Gazebo\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=gz\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:101
#: 7e89dbe725c147b9ad2595381c27f0f1
msgid "Isaac Sim"
msgstr "Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:103
#: 3a56e409a9b44f43a335392b6089e819
msgid "FaSim-Isaac scripts"
msgstr "FaSim-Isaac 脚本"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:106
#: 72587c72cd704f51a0abdd07f6de738c
msgid ""
"Use **FaSim-Isaac** `./init.sh` then `./run.sh`. Default Isaac path is "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim`); override in `config/fa_sim.local.conf`. "
"Version for the optional ROS 2 workspace comes from the init menu (fallback "
"list in `config/fa_sim.conf`), not a hardcoded minor version in these docs."
msgstr ""
"使用 **FaSim-Isaac** 的 `./init.sh`，再运行 `./run.sh`。默认 Isaac 路径是 "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR`（`~/isaacsim`）；在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` 中覆盖。可选 ROS 2 "
"工作空间的版本来自 init 菜单（回退列表见 `config/fa_sim.conf`），不要在文档里写死某个次版本号。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:109
#: 0f9b7e1e9ccc436e9bd80044b46d58bf
msgid ""
"Install NVIDIA Isaac Sim (default directory `~/isaacsim`, or set "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR`)."
msgstr "安装 NVIDIA Isaac Sim（默认目录 `~/isaacsim`，或设置 `ISAACSIM_DIR`）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:110
#: e40e0173da76415eab2a3d48759eb3e3
msgid "Clone and initialize FaSim-Isaac:"
msgstr "克隆并初始化 FaSim-Isaac："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:111
#: c699ac38b240409a9a1672dd4dd16a2c
msgid ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:116
#: 5f805e9521ca456a9ef436703b127ea1
msgid "Start Isaac (`./run.sh` menu: PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming):"
msgstr "启动 Isaac（`./run.sh` 菜单：PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:117
#: 488a49a41bef4f38ae860ff2db6d657c
msgid "./run.sh\n"
msgstr "./run.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:120
#: 83cdd0e1bef74c7e84bfafd8ce1ac5c2
msgid "In another terminal, launch the ROS 2 side with Isaac hardware:"
