msgstr "**预期结果：** 基于物理的仿真，可使用 Gazebo 或 Isaac Sim。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:129
#: 3d87379899d74b9bbb87f90680fe786b
msgid "Day 4: Python Interface"
msgstr "第 4 天：Python 接口"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:131
#: 66ca794cb18e4fca928aeb985f78c51e
msgid "**Goal:** Control the robot programmatically."
msgstr "**目标：** 以编程方式控制机器人。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:134
#: 50bda7ddf3c049bcac125011e91fd4cf
msgid "Install fa-py-libraries:"
msgstr "安装 fa-py-libraries："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:135
#: 31c353b9111a4b8bbd77985f6ded98fb
msgid ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all    # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2_robot_interface and related submodules\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all    # Python 3.12 env; installs ros2_robot_interface and related submodules\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:141
#: 66eac7b8d7ca4636b44717b776e6b7a5
msgid "Write a simple script:"
msgstr "编写一个简单脚本："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:142
#: ab0a766b50d443ceab4bad3d6932588a
msgid ""
"from ros2_robot_interface import RobotInterface\n"
"\n"
"robot = RobotInterface()\n"
"robot.connect()\n"
"robot.move_j([0.0, -0.5, 0.5, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0])\n"
"robot.gripper_close()\n"
msgstr ""
"from ros2_robot_interface import RobotInterface\n"
"\n"
"robot = RobotInterface()\n"
"robot.connect()\n"
"robot.move_j([0.0, -0.5, 0.5, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0])\n"
"robot.gripper_close()\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:151
#: a077320c41154425a58af0348e9ddafe
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** [fa-py-libraries](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-"
"py-libraries), [ros2_robot_interface](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** [fa-py-libraries](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-"
"libraries)、[ros2_robot_interface](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:153
#: 1c07309118f6409e842cf3d8df595a1d
msgid "**Outcome:** You can script robot motions in Python."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 你可以用 Python 编写机器人运动脚本。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:155
#: 151efe3aca514a9a81babe1795312108
msgid "Day 5: Teleoperation"
msgstr "第 5 天: 遥操作"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:157
#: 368c57e26ad3432fa695c6a535a19ef9
msgid "**Goal:** Control the robot via VR or isomorphic teleop."
msgstr "**目标：** 通过 VR 或同构遥操作控制机器人。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:159
#: 05e2f867eff5496693daf8ee68c0acaf
msgid "VR Teleoperation"
msgstr "VR 遥操作"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:161
#: d2bad835a17f4eda8a755729243dabe2
msgid ""
"**Supported headsets:** Pico Enterprise (recommended; USB 网络共享, Enterprise "
"App), Pico consumer (different App), and Meta Quest. Backends: WebXR "
"(`./run.sh vr`) or XRoboToolkit (`./run.sh vr-xrt`)."
msgstr ""
"**支持的头显：** Pico 企业版（推荐；USB 网络共享、企业版 App）、Pico 消费版（不同 App）和 Meta "
"Quest。后端：WebXR（`./run.sh vr`）或 XRoboToolkit（`./run.sh vr-xrt`）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:163
#: 5de69646b9224bf780a88cb2d2e8de56
msgid ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr\n"
msgstr ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:168
#: 2e295ba45fc642cbb623827b0078b1ec
msgid "Pico Enterprise vs consumer"
msgstr "Pico 企业版与消费版"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:171
#: 7f08c184a5974a7c958f1d73f6aababc
msgid ""
"Pico **Enterprise** and Pico **consumer** are different SKUs: Enterprise "
"supports USB 网络共享 and uses a **different App**. Do not install one App for "
"both."
msgstr ""
"Pico **企业版** 与 Pico **消费版** 是不同 SKU：企业版支持 USB 网络共享，并使用**不同的 App**。不要为两者安装同一个"
" App。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:174
#: 815e2dc8323f4019b6b02ef780ec14d0
msgid "Isomorphic Teleop (HighTorque Panthera HT)"
msgstr "同构遥操作（高擎 Panthera HT）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:176
#: 8c24aed97a0644b98bf97d9d27c42d66
msgid ""
"Master–slave **isomorphic teleop** (同构遥操作). On the `panthera-ht` branch, "
"real-robot teleop is `./teleop_start.sh` — see [HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md). Mock (package README):"
msgstr ""
"主从 **同构遥操作**。在 `panthera-ht` 分支上，真机遥操作是 `./teleop_start.sh` — 见 [高擎 Panthera"
" HT](../2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md)。模拟（软件包 README）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:178
#: 52b299dd7458485d9e1bd635d84a9a7b
msgid ""
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:185
#: 4b476d3006494927a270cf4280e15ddd
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** VR pose publisher, "
"[drag_teleop_controller](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** VR 位姿发布器、[drag_teleop_controller](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:187
#: 4a1e1e9da0b243fab0c3e08e5b29f495
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** Real-time control via VR headset or master–slave isomorphic "
"teleop."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 通过 VR 头显或主从同构遥操作进行实时控制。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:189
#: 845abc9d01554333ab5e4a95e7c919b2
msgid "Day 6: Real Hardware"
msgstr "第 6 天：真实硬件"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:191
#: 67a946ed69d3479e8e6a3d2c7b8df90c
msgid "**Goal:** Deploy to physical robots."
msgstr "**目标：** 部署到实体机器人。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:193
#: 1bf9367ddd794fab89439b232d539181
msgid "Public Path (ARX Lift 2S, Acone arm, HighTorque Panthera HT)"
msgstr "公开路径（方舟无限 Lift 2S、Acone 机械臂、高擎 Panthera HT）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:195
#: d3f64a0ac8cd4284bc2e54adceea3107
msgid ""
"Use the matching **branch README** and `./quick_start.sh`. Do not treat "
"Acone as Lift 2S."
msgstr "使用对应 **分支 README** 和 `./quick_start.sh`。不要把 Acone 当成 Lift 2S。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:197
#: 6b9d09f40cc8443d875266086bc6ae13
msgid ""
"**[ARX Lift 2S](../2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md)** — full-body including "
"chassis: `git clone -b arx-lift2s …` then `./init_repo.sh` / "
"`./quick_start.sh`"
msgstr ""
"**[方舟无限 Lift 2S](../2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md)** — 全身含底盘：`git clone -b arx-"
"lift2s …` 然后 `./init_repo.sh` / `./quick_start.sh`"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:198
#: ca0e364900614db6a720b61ddef2cd92
msgid ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** — **arm only**; same `arx-lift2s` workspace, pick "
"ACone in `quick_start` for co-debug"
msgstr ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** — **仅机械臂**；同一 `arx-lift2s` 工作空间，在 `quick_start` 中选 "
"ACone 做联调"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:199
#: 4fbb4a5717b34a42a01c6f3b3cab407d
msgid ""
"**[HighTorque Panthera HT](../2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md)** — dual-arm: `git"
" clone -b panthera-ht …` then `./init_repo.sh` / `./quick_start.sh`"
msgstr ""
"**[高擎 Panthera HT](../2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md)** — 双臂：`git clone -b "
"panthera-ht …` 然后 `./init_repo.sh` / `./quick_start.sh`"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:201
#: 82fa281761fa4c5fa703ecc215fdc434
msgid "Internal Path (FA Robots)"
msgstr "内部路径（FA 机器人）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:203
#: fd144a55a1114fb088140a9f4a028a58
msgid "Internal Access Required"
msgstr "需要内部访问权限"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:206
#: 9580d34f15eb44349c7644f2834f4c0c
msgid ""
"FA robots (W2, W2R, S2, S2R, dual-arm CCS) require access to `fa-deploy-ws`."
" Contact your team lead for repository access and hardware allocation."
msgstr "FA 机器人（W2、W2R、S2、S2R、双臂 CCS）需要访问 `fa-deploy-ws`。请联系团队负责人申请仓库权限并分配硬件。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:210
#: cacc08c272f34a2898203f4620649d22
msgid "Clone `fa-deploy-ws` and initialize for your robot (e.g., W2):"
msgstr "克隆 `fa-deploy-ws` 并为你的机器人初始化（例如 W2）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:211
#: 768df9265325431f93914f4281927471
msgid ""
"git clone <internal-url>/fa-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd fa-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh --robot fiveages_w2\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone <internal-url>/fa-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd fa-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh --robot fiveages_w2\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:216
#: 6497b72cffa349f78bc60da0585b3240
msgid ""
"Configure `robot.local.yaml` with your robot's parameters (network settings,"
" domain ID, etc.)"
msgstr "在 `robot.local.yaml` 中配置机器人参数（网络设置、Domain ID 等）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:217
#: 2733c88f4d52498bac1b1190756bd454
msgid "Run the quick start:"
msgstr "运行快速启动："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:218
#: 6f55e846cc2d47d2b349c962d60713fa
msgid "./quick_start.sh\n"
msgstr "./quick_start.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:222
#: 89211c93975a41fcac6f60a1080b7097
msgid ""
"**Safety:** Always start with `mock` mode, verify trajectories, then switch "
"to real hardware."
msgstr "**安全：** 始终先从 `mock` 模式开始，确认轨迹无误后再切换到真实硬件。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:224
#: c56e8770a9ad4c1b8b9472d06eaaf221
msgid "Day 7+: Add a Robot"
msgstr "第 7 天及以后：添加机器人"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:226
#: dcb68e4118934b71b17c51be22bb575c
msgid "**Goal:** Integrate a new robot into the ecosystem."
msgstr "**目标：** 将新机器人集成到生态系统中。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:229
#: bdd404522c8c47d984855e4c5fbffc43
msgid "Create a description package with URDF/xacro"
msgstr "用 URDF/xacro 创建描述包"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:230
#: e8c485b3a9b34de1a1a840f2b1a8df69
msgid "Add ros2_control hardware interface YAML"
msgstr "添加 ros2_control 硬件接口 YAML"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:231
#: adc26f64610a4a41a85436d10da00ab8
msgid "Configure OCS2 controller parameters"
msgstr "配置 OCS2 控制器参数"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:232
#: 82a224418bfe40aa81b58c083a372594
msgid "Test progression: mock → simulation → real hardware"
msgstr "测试进阶顺序：mock → 仿真 → 真实硬件"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:234
#: 6d056fa3b7bb428288802587bb1eaac6
msgid ""
"See the [Developer Guide](../5-developer/0-index.md) for detailed "
"instructions."
msgstr "详细说明请参阅[开发者指南](../5-developer/0-index.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:236
#: f91b8e7d69a84c8386e1b25877c598cd
msgid "Optional: Synthetic data (Isaac)"
msgstr "可选：合成数据（Isaac）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:238
#: 23a21a95f6cd461aba49a88be8c29520
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Understand the Isaac datagen path (not Gazebo): USD scene → "
"`ROS2RobotInterface` → composer `task_queue` → LeRobot dataset on disk."
msgstr ""
"**目标：** 弄清 Isaac 数据采集路径（不是 Gazebo）：USD 场景 → `ROS2RobotInterface` → composer "
"`task_queue` → 磁盘上的 LeRobot 数据集。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:240
#: 36cda747d5bf4d7a9ec81dc8943aff88
msgid ""
"Follow [Synthetic Data](../6-synthetic_data/0-index.md). Documented "
"composer/lerobot branches are `feature/dex-grasp-generator` and "
"`feature/sim-grasp-datagen`. Stop at recording/export; skip training."
msgstr ""
"见 [合成数据](../6-synthetic_data/0-index.md)。文档对应的 composer/lerobot 分支是 "
"`feature/dex-grasp-generator` 与 `feature/sim-grasp-datagen`。停在录制/导出；跳过训练。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:242
#: 764081499e3f48b6bce474b810175b61
msgid "Tips for Success"
msgstr "实用建议"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:244
#: 12e1d9a435994f5ea4e775f3711a5aa4
msgid ""
"**Don't skip mock mode** — Always verify behavior in mock before simulation "
"or real hardware"
msgstr "**不要跳过 mock 模式** — 在进入仿真或真实硬件之前，务必先在 mock 中验证行为"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:245
#: 5fe8801af4a640619719cc89868ac55f
msgid ""
"**Read the warnings** — The stack logs helpful messages about configuration "
"issues"
msgstr "**阅读警告信息** — 技术栈会记录有助于排查配置问题的日志"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:246
#: 90e59a51820b4eebb1e0ea9314343ae9
msgid ""
"**Use lean branches** — `open-deploy-ws` offers `dobot-cr5`, `arx-lift2s`, "
"and `panthera-ht`"
msgstr ""
"**使用精简分支** — `open-deploy-ws` 提供 `dobot-cr5`、`arx-lift2s` 和 `panthera-ht`"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:247
#: 6eb2b9637aba4525a3c01a314b104ca6
msgid ""
"**Ask questions** — File issues on the relevant repository for bugs or "
"unclear documentation"
msgstr "**提出问题** — 遇到缺陷或文档不清时，请在相应仓库提交 issue"

